 		\item $\mathcal S$ is an SPCC (symmetric, projective, consistent, commuting) strategy of value $1$;
 		\item the state is $\ket{\psi} = \ket{\mathrm{EPR}_q}^{\ot n} \ot \ket{\mathrm{EPR}_2}$;
